<!-- A17: the one LineageOS app with no lineage-24.0 branch, Trebuchet, taken from lineage-22.2.

     Every other app this file used to move to lineage-23.2 (LineageParts, Jelly, Dialer,
     Messaging, DeskClock, ExactCalculator, Etar, Gallery2, Aperture, Glimpse, Twelve, Recorder,
     Seedvault, Profiles, Backgrounds) has had a lineage-24.0 branch, and an entry in the
     lineage-24.0 manifest, since LineageOS forward-ported to 24.0 in late 2026. They now sync at
     upstream's own revision (bd remora-q6t5).

     Nothing installs Trebuchet: on 24.0 the launcher is the LineageOS fork of
     packages/apps/Launcher3. The project stays because the pin carries it, and the weekly image
     job refuses a refresh that drops a project the published pin has. -->
<manifest>
  <project name="LineageOS/android_packages_apps_Trebuchet" path="packages/apps/Trebuchet" remote="github" revision="lineage-22.2" />
</manifest>
